{"id": "EUVD-2026-102997", "enisaUuid": "09ba0bb1-9924-3d1f-b6d1-f681ef1cc84d", "description": "Fuint through commit 57ec018 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability that allows authenticated members to read other members' booking records by supplying arbitrary bookId values to /clientApi/book/myBookDetail. Attackers can iterate the auto-increment bookId to retrieve contact names, mobile numbers, in-store verification codes, service dates, stores and remarks.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:57", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T13:43:38", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/fuint-booking-detail-idor", "https://github.com/fushengqian/fuint/blob/57ec01895e22dd93f16f493db30a77a7c1b148f2/fuint-application/src/main/java/com/fuint/module/clientApi/controller/ClientBookController.java#L252-L265", "https://github.com/fushengqian/fuint/blob/57ec01895e22dd93f16f493db30a77a7c1b148f2/fuint-application/src/main/java/com/fuint/common/service/impl/BookItemServiceImpl.java#L237-L258", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/fuint-through-commit-57ec018-idor-via-bookid-in-mybookdetail"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111705", "GHSA-56j7-v63x-xw99"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "cf727ce3-78eb-342c-8695-71c2e87398b5", "product": {"name": "fuint", "vendor": {"name": "fushengqian"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226457ec01895e22dd93f16f493db30a77a7c1b148f2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "399fc802-5dcd-3f65-9fb7-8de020e287b9", "vendor": {"name": "fushengqian"}}], "isExploited": false}